ade."},{"id":"marker12","name":"The Grey Jaguar","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious grilled olives with sour vodka is served here."},{"id":"marker13","name":"The Honest Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious fried zucchini with sour kumis is served here."},{"id":"marker14","name":"The High Cat","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious corned hart with blue whisky is served here."},{"id":"marker15","name":"The White Cat","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious deep-fried hart with smoky liquor is served here."},{"id":"marker16","name":"The Orange Rook","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious baked catfish with orange water is served here."},{"id":"marker17","name":"The Dark Bear","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious poached bear with fire absinthe is served here."},{"id":"marker18","name":"The Grey Goose","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious dried goose with bright mead is served here."},{"id":"marker19","name":"The Grey Fox","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious boiled fox with misty absinthe is served here."},{"id":"marker20","name":"The Big Scorpion","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious deep-fried potato with yellow whisky is served here."},{"id":"marker21","name":"The Fair Inn","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious pan-fried broccoli with purple cider is served here."},{"id":"marker22","name":"The Orange Antelope","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious braised quail with misty absinthe is served here."},{"id":"marker23","name":"The Golden Snake","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious dried snake with red rom is served here."},{"id":"marker24","name":"The Beautiful Inn","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious fried pike with white nectar is served here."},{"id":"marker25","name":"The Big Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious deep-fried bread with ic