ent effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༔༜༇༪༰༆༺༮༆༥༓༔༃༨༁༄༸༆༯༘༓༔༨༲༩༓༶༰༰༫༷༁༣༮༾༃༪༑༈༥༸༩༔༬༼༲༲</div>"},{"id":"marker129","name":"Rhampiapa Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༤༊༩༪༮༫༕༿༓༦༌༴༩༡༭༤༊༽༑༸༉༈༱༬༐༼༴༔༱༻༖༪༛༕༲་་༫༌༣༾༛༜༳༫༬༌༖༪༫༾༺་༬༬༑༾༜༵༔༳༇༑༔༵༵༫༛༬༶༂༗༯༈༈༢༑༆༜༑༗༈༚༕༣༌༨༜༂༅༬༼</div>"},{"id":"marker130","name":"Comurilaco Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༹༚༄༳༿༴༵༢༠༼༭༁༐ༀ༡༙༇༴༯༺༔༔༶༑༆ༀ༳༺༧༉༗༣༔༾༥༠་༦༨༷༺༚༽༨༇༴༓༹༕༚༢༆༥༘༬༜༬༅༒༴༫༱༶༑</div>"},{"id":"marker131","name":"Asktos Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳧⳪ⳔⳖⳂ⳥ⳘⳘⳃⳐⳎ⳾ⳁ⳹ⲲⳂⳃⳊⳒ ⳫⲾⳈⲼⳠⳠⳊⳖ ⳁⳒ ⳎⳌⳤⳊ ⳩ⳲⳖ⳥</div>"},{"id":"marker132","name":"Igansium Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༭༜༛༭༃་༔༨༖༳༉༣༛༖༫༉༗༦༤༺༳༥༱༗༁༚༒༵༻༜༇༫༱༉༣༻༨༉༓༨༕༢༡༄༗༒༒༜༌༓༽༦༯༙༂༢༰༌༩༄༯༼༶༯༣༇༐༕༵༗༰༘༳</div>"},{"id":"marker133","name":"Hakun Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጰሀነፐፐረሀጸጸደለሀገቀፀየ ነወቀረሠሐቀመፈከሰተሐከጰጠሰሀጸኀ ሀፐሀወጰጸደአዘቀጰ ነኀለዐበበዐፈተ ወአረከቀረለተጸመ ሐአመየተመበኀሰፐበቀገጸአሐደዐሰሰ ፀገዘጠ ረሠፐ</div>"},{"id":"marker134","name":"Agrumperun Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳠⳊⳢⳐⳖⳞⳃⲺⳖⳭⳜⳔⳖⳬⳊⳐⳭⳭⳐⲾ ⳖⳠⳫⳊ⳾ⳲⳤⳄ Ⳇ⳧ⳒⳭⲾⳁⲾⳔⳲ Ⳕⳁⳁ⳩ ⳧ⲸⳈⲼⳢ ⳥ⳬⲸⳫ⳥Ⳉ ⳖⳫⳒⳘⳭⲸⳆⲼ  Ⳉ ⳲⳃⳌ⳪ ⳤⲾⳤⳲ ⳩ⳃⳘⲶⳒⳀⲼⳜⳜ</div>"},{"id":"marker135","name":"Paniscacen Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"fon