uge group of lions are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker166","name":"Geese migration","legend":"A huge group of geese are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker167","name":"Jackals migration","legend":"A huge group of jackals are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker168","name":"Drurum ball","legend":"A ball has been organised at Drurum as a chance to gather the suspected revolutionaries of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"id":"marker169","name":"Distant mirage","legend":"This distant mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker170","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker171","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker172","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker173","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker174","name":"Movalbiumpe Ravine","legend":"The Movalbiumpe Ravine. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"id":"marker175","name":"Vahangari Cavern","legend":"The Vahangari Cavern. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"id":"marker176","name":"Ahedstan Pit","legend":"The Ahedstan Pit. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"id":"marker177","name":"Bonarea Cavern","legend":"The Bonarea Cavern. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"id":"marker178","name":"Nafustar Tomb","legend":"Rising from the desolate landscape, this sinister necropolis is a testament to necromantic power. Its skeletal s